{"id":"T1055","name":"Process Injection","tactics":["privilege-escalation","stealth"],"description":"Adversaries may inject code into processes in order to evade process-based defenses as well as possibly elevate privileges. Process injection is a method of executing arbitrary code in the address space of a separate live process. Running code in the context of another process may allow access to the process's memory, system/network resources, and possibly elevated privileges. Execution via process injection may also evade detection from security products since the execution is masked under a legitimate process. There are many different ways to inject code into a process, many of which abuse l","status":"paper_only","claimed_by":[{"id":"CIS-13.2","title":""},{"id":"CIS-4.1","title":""},{"id":"CIS-4.7","title":""},{"id":"CIS-5.3","title":""},{"id":"CIS-5.4","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.1","title":""},{"id":"CIS-6.2","title":""}],"live_rules":[],"dead_rules":[{"id":"02d1d718-dd13-41af-989d-ea85c7fab93f","title":"Rare Remote Thread Creation By Uncommon Source Image","level":"high","requires":["windows/create_remote_thread"]},{"id":"0e7163d4-9e19-4fa7-9be6-000c61aad77a","title":"CobaltStrike Named Pipe Pattern Regex","level":"critical","requires":["windows/pipe_created"]},{"id":"0fa66f66-e3f6-4a9c-93f8-4f2610b00171","title":"Potential DLL Sideloading Using Coregen.exe","level":"medium","requires":["windows/image_load"]},{"id":"16b37b70-6fcf-4814-a092-c36bd3aafcbd","title":"PowerShell ShellCode","level":"high","requires":["windows/ps_script"]},{"id":"16c37b52-b141-42a5-a3ea-bbe098444397","title":"Suspect Svchost Activity","level":"high","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"1cc50f3f-1fc8-4acf-b2e9-6f172e1fdebd","title":"Suspicious Rundll32 Invoking Inline VBScript","level":"high","requires":["windows/process_creation"]},{"id":"33a2d1dd-f3b0-40bd-8baf-7974468927cc","title":"APT PRIVATELOG Image Load Pattern","level":"high","requires":["windows/image_load"]},{"id":"39